    "body": "### Problem\n\nThere is no way to access Nvim's startup time from within Nvim. This statistic would be useful for stuff like dashboards, ad hoc `:echo v:startuptime`, etc.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nA `v:startuptime` variable is exposed which provides the time it took Nvim to startup.\n\n### Open questions\n- What exactly should this number represent? The server's startup time? The total time? Something else?\n\nProposed by [@echasnovski on Matrix](https://matrix.to/#/!cylwlNXSwagQmZSkzs:matrix.org/$q3IVve0Bveds4oqR4zAVcCJLpKz5rsnP0m0dI4iZSB4?via=mozilla.org&via=matrix.org&via=gitter.im).\n\ncc @bfredl ",
